@startuml component_diagram_refined
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

' ==========================
' 1. PRESENTATION LAYER
' ==========================
[API Layer] <<component>>

' ==========================
' 2. APPLICATION / SERVICE LAYER
' ==========================
[Application Services] <<component>>

' ==========================
' 3. CONTRACTS
' ==========================
package "Data Access Contracts" {
    () "Repository Interfaces" as IRepository
}

package "Infrastructure Contracts" {
    () "Auth Provider Interface" as IAuthProvider
    () "Media Storage Interface" as IMediaStorage
}

' ==========================
' 4. INFRASTRUCTURE
' ==========================
[Persistence Layer] <<component>>
[Auth Adapter (Cognito)] <<component>>
[Storage Adapter (S3)] <<component>>

' ==========================
' RELAZIONI
' ==========================
[API Layer] .down.> [Application Services] : invoke

[Application Services] ..> IRepository
[Application Services] ..> IAuthProvider
[Application Services] ..> IMediaStorage

[Persistence Layer] -up- IRepository
[Auth Adapter (Cognito)] -up- IAuthProvider
[Storage Adapter (S3)] -up- IMediaStorage

@enduml
